stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Observe
    Observe --> Notice: owner/probe/lookup invalid
    Observe --> Intent: Missing or exact Legacy
    Intent --> Recheck: durable queue commit, release locks
    Recheck --> Notice: witnesses changed
    Recheck --> UnlinkCanonical: physical locks then Source
    UnlinkCanonical --> UnlinkLegacy
    UnlinkLegacy --> Recover: partial unlink
    Recover --> Recheck: durable intent + fresh evidence
    UnlinkLegacy --> ReceiptCommit
    ReceiptCommit --> Boot: crash before commit
    ReceiptCommit --> OutboxCommit: durable receipt
    OutboxCommit --> Boot: crash before outbox
    OutboxCommit --> Wake
    Boot --> Recover: intent only
    Boot --> OutboxCommit: receipt or outbox debt
    Wake --> Admission
    Admission --> Wait: before + Found Legacy
    Wait --> Wait
    Admission --> Notice: front/epoch/file/row changed
    Admission --> Grant: fixed + fresh proof + fence
    Grant --> Create: exact front claim
    Create --> Prompt: Pending and host/spawn published, release fence
    Prompt --> Ack
    Wake --> Wake: duplicate delivery does not grant
    Notice --> Ack: retain original, durable notice
    Ack --> [*]
